              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Suremani aasookiri irisabhi reee, ömörro gögaika kurua kuriöbha na gösamba ibhiruusio na ibhimuenso bhia gösambërëërröa bhino bhiaruusibhui, hakurua ubhuhiku bhö ÖMÖNENE bhögaichuuria ëhekaru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.1"
            ]
